    "groundingSupports": [
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 32,
       "endIndex": 136,
       "text": "This is a **solid baseline offer**, but it leaves substantial money on the table for a passive candidate"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 142,
       "endIndex": 243,
       "text": "**Leveling:** Meta IC6 (Staff PM) to Google L6 (Senior PM / Group PM) is an appropriate lateral match"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 451,
       "endIndex": 468,
       "text": "$276,000 at Meta)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 472,
       "endIndex": 572,
       "text": "**Base Salary Band:** With a posted range of $183,000 to $271,000, $235,000 sits around the midpoint"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 576,
       "endIndex": 689,
       "text": "**Sign-on Bonus:** At **$0**, it fails to account for the risk and unvested Meta equity you are walking away from"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 755,
       "endIndex": 880,
       "text": "Google typically uses a **front-loaded vesting schedule** for initial grants (33% Year 1, 33% Year 2, 22% Year 3, 12% Year 4)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 884,
       "endIndex": 953,
       "text": "| Year | Base Salary | Target Bonus (20%) | GSU Vesting (33/33/22/12)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1515,
       "endIndex": 1590,
       "text": "**The \"Cliff\" in Years 3 & 4:** Total comp drops significantly after Year 2"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1592,
       "endIndex": 1754,
       "text": "Annual refresh grants (which vest evenly at 25%/year over 4 years) are meant to fill this gap, but they are performance-dependent and not contractually guaranteed"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1759,
       "endIndex": 1904,
       "text": "**Flat 4-Year Average:** If viewed as a flat 4-year package, the average is **$552,000/year**, which is only ~5% above your current Meta earnings"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2024,
       "endIndex": 2048,
       "text": "Google initiated contact"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2102,
       "endIndex": 2145,
       "text": "Your current compensation ($526k) is strong"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2277,
       "endIndex": 2358,
       "text": "Present a counter-offer targeting the upper quartile for an L6 PM in the Bay Area"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2676,
       "endIndex": 2804,
       "text": "**Base Salary ($255,000):** Brings you above your current Meta base ($240,000) and into the upper half of the $183k\u2013$271k band"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2808,
       "endIndex": 2953,
       "text": "**Equity ($1,250,000):** Increases your 4-year average equity from $270k/yr to $312.5k/yr, providing greater protection against the Year 3/4 drop"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2957,
       "endIndex": 3067,
       "text": "**Sign-On Bonus ($80,000):** Offsets leaving your near-term unvested Meta equity cliff and the transition risk"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3113,
       "endIndex": 3255,
       "text": "Frame the negotiation positively while emphasizing that leaving a stable, high-performing situation at Meta requires a stronger financial case"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3409,
       "endIndex": 3561,
       "text": "*Because Google reached out while I am well-established and happy at Meta, making a move needs to be compelling across the entire compensation structure"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3641,
       "endIndex": 3740,
       "text": "I would like to see the base salary at **$255,000**, which is within the posted range for this role"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3748,
       "endIndex": 3915,
       "text": "*To bridge the equity I am walking away from over the coming year (around $200k vesting) and account for the transition, I am asking for a sign-on bonus of **$80,000**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3923,
       "endIndex": 4066,
       "text": "*To ensure the long-term package remains competitive across all four years, I would like to increase the initial equity grant to **$1,250,000**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4182,
       "endIndex": 4316,
       "text": "**Confirm the vesting schedule in writing:** Ensure your offer details whether it is the 33/33/22/12 model or a flat 25%/year schedule"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4321,
       "endIndex": 4517,
       "text": "**Anchor high and hold firm:** If Google pushes back on base salary, shift the focus toward a larger sign-on bonus and increased equity grant size, where recruiters typically have wider discretion"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
